	(descr "BAT Wireless BW0019CG-L3.5W1.5H4.3 SMT antenna spring (LCSC C2826517; BW0019BG-L3.5W1.5H3.8 C2826516 fits). Drawing 681-0019C-3: body 3.5 x 1.5 mm, free height 4.3, working height 3.0-3.5, land 2.10 x 1.50 at the contact end. ORIGIN = BODY CENTRE; CONTACT POINT (dome) = (0, +0.85), 0.90 +-0.15 mm from the contact end. The contact end (free end of the cantilever) points +y: place +y toward the wall so a panel sliding toward the wall rides over the spring from its root bend. The root bend overhangs the board (y -1.75..-0.35) at 0.33 mm.")
